        "\n",
        "Each patient can have multiple CT slices. This cell averages slice-level predicted probabilities so that each patient receives one final survival prediction.\n",
        "\n",
        "Patient-level evaluation is more appropriate for clinical interpretation because survival status belongs to the patient, not to an individual image slice.\n",
